+## CORS
+
+The totem's web build runs on a local static server during development. The
+`api/*` paths answer CORS for origins `http(s)://localhost[:port]` and
+`http(s)://127.0.0.1[:port]`, plus the optional `TOTEM_WEB_ORIGIN` env. Any
+other origin gets no `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` header. No credentials are
+supported. Configured in `config/cors.php`. For example, a preflight
+`OPTIONS api/totem/auth` from `http://localhost:8081` answers `204` with
+`Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:8081`.
