+| `TOTEM_JWT_TTL` | `services.totem.jwt_ttl` | `3600` | Token lifetime in seconds |
+| `TOTEM_WEB_ORIGIN` | `cors.allowed_origins` | empty | Extra CORS origin for the totem web build |
